# PRD BACKEND API - APLIKASI KASIR UMKM V1

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Backend akan digunakan oleh aplikasi Android Native (Java).

Framework:

* Laravel 11
* PHP 7.4
* MySQL
* Laravel Sanctum Authentication

Database:

```env
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=kasir-umkm
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=
```

Tujuan aplikasi:

Membuat sistem kasir sederhana untuk UMKM yang memiliki:

* Login User
* Single Device Login
* Master Customer
* Master Produk
* Harga Produk Berdasarkan Golongan Customer
* Transaksi Penjualan
* Void Transaksi
* Cetak Struk
* Laporan Penjualan
* Laporan Margin

---

# 2. SCOPE V1

## Included

### Authentication

* Login
* Logout
* Profile
* Single Device Login

### Master

* Customer Group
* Customer
* Product
* Payment Method
* App Setting

### Transaction

* Create Sales
* Detail Sales
* List Sales
* Void Sales
* Receipt Data

### Reports

* Daily Report
* Weekly Report
* Monthly Report
* Product Report
* Customer Report
* Payment Method Report

---

## Not Included (Future Version)

### Inventory Module

Belum digunakan pada V1.

Fitur berikut belum aktif:

* Stock Validation
* Stock Reduction
* Stock Adjustment
* Stock Mutation
* Inventory Report

Tetapi struktur database tetap disiapkan agar mudah dikembangkan pada V2.

---

# 3. AUTHENTICATION

Menggunakan Laravel Sanctum.

## Single Device Login Rules

Jika user login dari device baru:

1. Token lama dihapus.
2. Token baru dibuat.
3. Device lama otomatis logout.

---

## Additional User Fields

Tambahkan ke table users:

```text
phone nullable
role
device_id nullable
device_name nullable
last_login_at nullable
status default 00
created_at
updated_at
```

Role:

```text
admin
kasir
```

Status:

```text
00 = aktif
99 = nonaktif
```

---

# 4. DATABASE STRUCTURE

## customer_groups

```text
id
group_code
group_name
status
created_at
updated_at
```

Default Data:

```text
USER
FREELANCER
GROSIR
```

---

## customers

```text
id
customer_code nullable
customer_name
phone nullable
address nullable
customer_group_id
status
created_at
updated_at
```

---

## products

```text
id
product_code nullable
product_name
unit nullable
cost_price
stock default 0
status
created_at
updated_at
```

Catatan:

Field stock hanya disiapkan untuk masa depan.

Pada V1:

* tidak digunakan
* tidak divalidasi
* tidak dikurangi saat transaksi

---

## product_prices

Harga berdasarkan golongan customer.

```text
id
product_id
customer_group_id
selling_price
status
created_at
updated_at
```

Unique:

```text
product_id
customer_group_id
```

Contoh:

Produk Aqua

```text
USER        5000
FREELANCER  4500
GROSIR      4000
```

---

## payment_methods

```text
id
method_code
method_name
status
created_at
updated_at
```

Default:

```text
CASH
TRANSFER
QRIS
```

---

## sales_h

Header transaksi.

```text
id
invoice_no
invoice_date
user_id
customer_id
customer_group_id
payment_method_id

subtotal
discount
grand_total

total_modal
total_margin

paid_amount
change_amount

status

void_reason nullable
void_by nullable
void_at nullable

created_at
updated_at
```

Status:

```text
00 = sukses
98 = void
99 = nonaktif
```

---

## sales_d

Detail transaksi.

```text
id
sales_h_id

product_id
product_name_snapshot

qty

cost_price
selling_price

subtotal
margin

status

created_at
updated_at
```

Snapshot wajib disimpan agar histori transaksi tetap aman jika produk berubah.

---

## app_settings

```text
id
setting_key
setting_value
status
created_at
updated_at
```

Default:

```text
store_name
store_address
store_phone
receipt_footer
```

---

## stock_mutations

Table ini tetap dibuat.

Namun belum digunakan pada V1.

```text
id
product_id
mutation_date
mutation_type
reference_type
reference_id
qty_in
qty_out
stock_before
stock_after
note
created_by
status
created_at
updated_at
```

