# 5. API AUTH

## POST /api/login

Request

```json
{
  "email": "admin@mail.com",
  "password": "password",
  "device_id": "ANDROID123",
  "device_name": "Samsung A55"
}
```

Response

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Login berhasil",
  "data": {
    "token": "TOKEN",
    "user": {}
  }
}
```

---

## POST /api/logout

Logout user.

---

## GET /api/profile

Menampilkan data user login.

---

# 6. API CUSTOMER GROUP

## GET /api/customer-groups

List customer group.

## POST /api/customer-groups

Tambah customer group.

## PUT /api/customer-groups/{id}

Edit customer group.

## DELETE /api/customer-groups/{id}

Update status menjadi 99.

---

# 7. API CUSTOMER

## GET /api/customers

Support filter:

```text
search
status
customer_group_id
```

## GET /api/customers/{id}

Detail customer.

## POST /api/customers

Tambah customer.

## PUT /api/customers/{id}

Edit customer.

## DELETE /api/customers/{id}

Soft delete.

Status menjadi 99.

---

# 8. API PRODUCT

## GET /api/products

List produk.

Response harus include:

```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "product_name": "Aqua",
  "prices": []
}
```

---

## GET /api/products/{id}

Detail produk.

---

## POST /api/products

Request:

```json
{
  "product_code": "PRD001",
  "product_name": "Aqua",
  "unit": "PCS",
  "cost_price": 3000,
  "prices": [
    {
      "customer_group_id": 1,
      "selling_price": 5000
    },
    {
      "customer_group_id": 2,
      "selling_price": 4500
    },
    {
      "customer_group_id": 3,
      "selling_price": 4000
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## PUT /api/products/{id}

Edit produk.

---

## DELETE /api/products/{id}

Status menjadi 99.

---

# 9. API PAYMENT METHOD

## GET

List payment method.

## POST

Tambah payment method.

## PUT

Edit payment method.

## DELETE

Status menjadi 99.

---

# 10. SALES TRANSACTION

## POST /api/sales

Request:

```json
{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "payment_method_id": 1,
  "discount": 0,
  "paid_amount": 50000,
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "qty": 2
    },
    {
      "product_id": 2,
      "qty": 1
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## Sales Flow

### Step 1

Ambil customer.

### Step 2

Ambil customer group.

### Step 3

Cari harga produk berdasarkan:

```text
product_id
customer_group_id
```

dari table:

```text
product_prices
```

### Step 4

Hitung:

```text
subtotal
discount
grand_total
total_modal
total_margin
change_amount
```

### Step 5

Generate invoice.

Format:

```text
INV-YYYYMMDD-0001
```

### Step 6

Simpan ke:

```text
sales_h
sales_d
```

---

## Catatan Penting

Pada V1:

```text
TIDAK ADA
pengurangan stok
validasi stok
stock mutation
```

---

# 11. LIST SALES

## GET /api/sales

Filter:

```text
start_date
end_date
customer_id
user_id
status
search
```

---

# 12. DETAIL SALES

## GET /api/sales/{id}

Menampilkan header dan detail transaksi.

---

# 13. VOID SALES

## POST /api/sales/{id}/void

Request:

```json
{
  "void_reason": "Customer batal beli"
}
```

Rules:

```text
status transaksi harus 00
```

Update:

```text
sales_h.status = 98
sales_d.status = 98

void_reason
void_by
void_at
```

Tidak ada proses stok.

---

# 14. RECEIPT API

## GET /api/sales/{id}/receipt

Digunakan Android untuk thermal printer.

Data:

```text
Nama Toko
Alamat
Invoice
Kasir
Customer
Item
Total
Bayar
Kembalian
Footer
```

